TikTok is a registered trademark of ByteDance Ltd. CommentGen is an independent project and is **not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by TikTok or ByteDance** in any way. The visual elements replicated in generated images are used solely to enable mockup creation for educational and creative purposes.

### Your generated images

You retain full ownership of the images you generate using the Service. By using the Service, you represent that your use of generated images complies with these Terms and all applicable laws.

